<section id="newsletter">
  <h2>The ModY newsletter</h2>
  <p class="lede" style="font-size:1rem">A short email when a Model Y accessory actually drops in price, plus new listings worth knowing about. No spam, and we won't sell your email.</p>
  <form class="signup" action="mailto:justintorch@mail.grokbot.com?subject=Add%20me%20to%20the%20ModY%20list" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" aria-label="Email address" required />
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Notify me</button>
  </form>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;margin-top:8px">Signing up opens your email app with a message to join the list. Just hit send. Nothing is stored on this site.</p>
</section>
